{"title": "四种请求的判定矩阵", "lines": [
  {"t": "note", "s": "从上到下：站内来源 / 盗链来源 / 无 Referer / 空 Referer"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -sI -H 'Referer: https://yourwebsite.com' localhost | head -1"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -sI -H 'Referer: https://evil.example/hotlink' localhost | head -1"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "HTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -sI localhost | head -1"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -sI -H 'Referer;' localhost | head -1"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:alpine 容器 (nginx/1.31.5)"}
]}
